{"surface": "inspector", "title": "Shock to NVDA", "html": "<header class=\"hero\"><p class=\"kicker\">Shock</p><h2 class=\"title\"><a class=\"go name\" data-go=\"name:NVDA\">NVDA</a></h2><p class=\"ctx\"><a class=\"go\" data-go=\"prop:3\">Jensen Huang returns to Nvidia in a formal role by May 18, 2027</a></p></header><h3 class=\"sub\">Residual</h3><div class=\"sz\"><div class=\"sz-row st\"><div class=\"sz-lab\"><span class=\"sz-t\">Shock</span><span class=\"sz-s\" title=\"Yes\">Yes</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:43.499%\"></i><i class=\"sz-seg st\" style=\"left:43.499%;right:calc(100% - 94.643%)\"></i></div><div class=\"sz-v\"><span class=\"n v\">+7.00%</span></div></div><div class=\"sz-row pw\"><div class=\"sz-lab\"><span class=\"sz-t\">Nov 11 – 18, 2026</span></div><div class=\"po-track\"><i class=\"po-zero\" style=\"left:43.499%\"></i><i class=\"sz-seg pw\" style=\"left:5.357%;right:calc(100% - 43.499%)\"></i></div><div class=\"sz-v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:window:link:94:0\"><span class=\"n v\">−5.22%</span></a></div></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Basis</h3><div class=\"basis note\"><div class=\"fold\"><div class=\"fold-in\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"From the day before the ouster report to Nov 18 Nvidia fell 5.2% beyond what the factors explain (window), through an earnings beat and raised outlook, while AMD and Broadcom gained 10-13% beyond theirs: a leadership-and-probe discount of roughly 15% against peers. A return as CEO would take back most of it, a board or advisory seat a small part; the market&#x27;s rules count either, and Polymarket US prices CEO at under half of all returns. I use +7% beyond what Nvidia would otherwise do.\"><p>From the day before the ouster report to Nov 18 Nvidia fell 5.2% beyond what the factors explain (window), through an earnings beat and raised outlook, while AMD and Broadcom gained 10-13% beyond theirs: a leadership-and-probe discount of roughly 15% against peers. A return as CEO would take back most of it, a board or advisory seat a small part; the market&#x27;s rules count either, and Polymarket US prices CEO at under half of all returns. I use +7% beyond what Nvidia would otherwise do.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Levels</h3><table class=\"cmp lv\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Today</th><td class=\"n\"><span class=\"n v\">$145.69</span></td></tr><tr><th>No <span class=\"otag\">Baseline</span></th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:94\"><span class=\"n v\">$144.18</span></a></td></tr><tr><th>Yes</th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:94\"><span class=\"n v\">$154.28</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:consequence:link:94\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}